  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "title": "AirGradient Air Quality",
  "uid": "airgradient",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Air quality from the AirGradient ONE at 192.168.0.96, scraped every 30s through the json exporter. Prometheus retention is 100y and no size limit is set, so nothing here is aged out on purpose \u2014 the two panels on the right of the second row show how far back the database actually reaches, so a silent loss is visible instead of being discovered months later."
}
